:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Celesse (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Celesse''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Celesse
|image = E 088.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
A pretty weak peon that shouldn't be considered threatening. Her money drop is pretty high for her stats, too.

Treat her like a slightly stronger version of [[Those Guys]].

